    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/apartment-68-collegeview-silloge-road-ballymun-dublin-d11-fc91-1\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present Apartment 68 Collegeview, Silloge Road, Ballymun.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Apartment 68, Collegeview, a charming two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment located in the heart of Ballymun, Dublin. This well-presented modern apartment lies within a contemporary complex surrounded by landscaped communal areas, offering a serene retreat amidst urban living.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a bright, open-plan living and dining area bathed in natural light from large windows. The layout flows seamlessly, augmented by fresh paint and renovated features. The south-east facing private balcony offers delightful views of the Dublin and Sugar Loaf mountains, providing a perfect spot for morning coffee or a relaxing evening. \r\n\r\nThe newly renovated kitchen, fitted with sleek cabinetry and integrated appliances, serves as a functional and stylish space for culinary enthusiasts.\r\n\r\nEach bedroom is generously proportioned, with the master benefiting from an ensuite bathroom, ensuring added convenience and privacy. Built-in wardrobes provide ample storage, while large windows throughout the apartment enhance the airy ambiance. \r\n\r\nExternally, the complex benefits from well-maintained communal gardens and ample parking spaces. Situated on Silloge Road, the apartment is within easy reach of local amenities, including DCU, parks, and various sports clubs. Excellent transport links are available, with several bus stops and access to main road networks nearby, making commuting effortless.\r\n\r\nThis property’s blend of modern living and practical design makes it ideal for first-time buyers or investors seeking a solid opportunity in a thriving location. The fresh, light-filled interior coupled with the proximity to essential services makes Apartment 68 a perfect urban retreat for those wanting a home that balances comfort with convenience."
      },
